        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Publication coverage\n\nThis initial table contains the grade-one SAT 10 impact in scaled-score points. The reviewed extraction includes 33 outcome contrasts (63 native or standardized representations); the remaining results are not yet published here.\n\nMatched delivery costs and complete program, implementation and measurement-concept links remain unresolved. No cost-effectiveness ranking is supported by this pilot.",
